Both chariots wheel and shower arrow nets --- Rāma drives back Rāvaṇa's four horses --- Rāvaṇa wounds Rāma and Mātali without effect --- Rāma showers Rāvaṇa's chariot with thousands of arrows --- Earth trembles and gods pray for Rāma --- Rāma beheads Rāvaṇa again and again --- New heads rise and a hundred fall in vain --- Rāma wonders at his dulled arrows --- Both rain weapons through night without pause
